Izo
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 50 DEAL TROUC
TROUC 2 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE TROUC TROUC
SRC Rank 1
MOVE_STACK TROUC TROUC
OR
    SRCSTACK Rank ascending
    AND
        SRCSTACK Suit match
        SRCSTACK Rank add_13
DRAW
PILE ANY DRAW Size > 0
$win
OR
    PILE ALL TROUC Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL TROUC Empty
        PILE ALL TROUC Empty
